          "type": "text",
          "plain_text": " fills the frame edge to edge with diving birds in deep cobalt on warm cream, no horizon, no resting point. All the movement is carried by shape rather than colour, which is much the harder way to do it, and it's why the print reads clearly from across a room while staying calm enough to hang above a bed. If you're buying one piece from us and you want the safest choice that doesn't feel like one, this is it. 50 x 70 cm.",
